      <p><strong>By submitting a request for a CUSIP identifier, the applicant (a) warrants that it has the legal authority to request a CUSIP identifier on behalf of the issuer and all information it supplies is true and correct in all material respects; and (b) acknowledges and agrees to the Disclaimer and Other Terms above.</strong></p>
